      537   ON CHOOSE OF b-links IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      538   DO:
      539   DEFINE VARIABLE v-rid-list AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
      540   case v-browse-mode:
      541     when "temp" then do:
      542       IF NOT AVAILABLE tt-ruleset THEN RETURN NO-APPLY.
      543     end.
      544     otherwise do:
      545       IF NOT AVAILABLE X_ruleset THEN RETURN NO-APPLY.
      546     end.
